  "mechanism": "Fully applied closed external dictionary methods select the exact loaded instance, declaring class/slot and actual private unit; checked ABI validation remains. Context, polymorphic, partial and strict-value factories retain ordinary dispatch. Scalar case rows carry actual matched facts and covering-row refutations; guarded failures never negate their pattern. Alias identities, certificate refresh and independent typing share the scoped rule.",
